WEBVTT

00:15:59.162 --> 00:16:02.708
to not only have, you know,
trees for environmental reasons,

00:16:02.708 --> 00:16:05.377
but also for food
because they are fruit trees.

00:16:05.377 --> 00:16:07.212
MR: And sometimes for health as well.

00:16:07.212 --> 00:16:08.588
VN: Exactly, yes.

00:16:08.588 --> 00:16:12.300
So those are some of the things
that I have seen here

00:16:12.342 --> 00:16:13.927
that are very inspiring.

00:16:14.553 --> 00:16:18.515
I remember being
in a conversation at COP26,

00:16:18.515 --> 00:16:22.728
and it was with some Indigenous leaders.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:28.984
And one of the leaders said that usually
before they make decisions,

00:16:29.026 --> 00:16:32.946
they always sit in a community
and ask themselves,